TI  - LONG-TERM GANCICLOVIR PROPHYLAXIS FOR SUCCESSFUL PREVENTION OF PRIMARY CYTOMEGALOVIRUS (CMV) DISEASE IN CMV-SERONEGATIVE LIVER TRANSPLANT RECIPIENTS WITH CMV-SEROPOSITIVE DONORS1
AU  - Philip Seu
