TI  - Acyclovir prophylaxis for cytomegalovirus disease in high-risk renal transplant recipients: is it effective?
AU  - Simin Göral
AU  - C Ynares
AU  - Stephen Dummer
AU  - J. Harold Helderman
JO  - PubMed
PY  - 1996
VL  - 57
SP  - S62
